# Personal Claude overrides

> This file is gitignored. Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md` and add personal preferences that you don't want to share with the team.
> Claude reads both `CLAUDE.md` (team) and `CLAUDE.local.md` (you) at session start.

## Personal preferences

- Use pnpm exclusively (project uses pnpm; this just reminds Claude not to suggest npm or yarn).
- When asking me a question, prefer a multiple-choice format over open-ended.
- Always show me the plan before writing code. Default to plan mode.

## Local environment

- Supabase is running on http://localhost:54321.
- Dev server defaults to port 3000.
